I pulled Cloudflare's job board feed (Greenhouse, which backs the careers site). It had 435 open roles, and 62 engineering-titled ones mention Rust in the description. These are five of them. I chose the five to give a spread of teams, so they aren't ranked.

```json
[
  {
    "title": "Principal Software Engineer, Workers Deploy & Config",
    "location": "Austin, TX (In-Office)",
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8055320"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Distributed Systems Engineer - Cache",
    "location": "Hybrid: Atlanta GA; Austin TX; Champaign IL; New York NY; San Francisco CA; Seattle WA; Washington DC",
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8163523"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Infrastructure Engineer, Storage Platform",
    "location": "In-Office: Austin TX; London, UK; Seattle WA",
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/7629805"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Software Engineer - Addressing Team",
    "location": "Hybrid: Austin TX; Lisbon, Portugal; London, UK",
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8164694"
  },
  {
    "title": "Senior Software Engineer, Cloudflare Hyperdrive",
    "location": "In-Office: Austin TX; Seattle WA",
    "link": "https://boards.greenhouse.io/cloudflare/jobs/8016162"
  }
]
```

- **Rust matching:** I matched "Rust" as a whole word anywhere in the description. In some postings it may only appear as one of several acceptable languages, not as the main one.
- **Locations:** I took them from each posting's office list. The feed's own location field only says "Hybrid" or "In-Office".
- **Links:** They point to the Greenhouse postings. I stripped the `?gh_jid=` tracking parameter, and the links should still work.
- **Saved data:** The raw feed is saved at `.firecrawl/cf.json`. The other 57 matches are in it if you want more.

